Hi Tariq,

The time-series variable should be the variable that marks the time period
for each observation, which sounds like the year column to me. You probably
want to include a spline of time with, say, 3-5 knots  in order to impute
from flexible trend lines within each site. You probably also want to
include the cross-section variable (site code) to account for mean-shifts
from site to site.

Cheers,
matt.

